{"item": "e042", "oracle_pass": false, "evidence": "checker: Rule judge for NUM with 5% relative tolerance: parsed model=[22.0], reference=[52.8]; mismatches: #1: 22.0 != 52.8 (relative error 0.5833) ", "skill_hash": "8d3999cbef62", "truth_source": "checker", "skill_result": "22\\%", "failure_reason": "题面说\"surface crack 3 mm in **length**\"，对表面裂纹而言 length 指全长 2a，代入 $K_{IC}=Y\\sigma\\sqrt{\\pi a}$ 的应是半长 $a=1.5$ mm；该解答错把 3 mm 直接当作 $a$（半长/深度）使用，导致临界尺寸与增长百分比都算错。正确做法是先由全长折半得到初始 $a$，再求临界 $a_c$，最后以初始 $a$ 为基准计算增长百分比。"}
